      "label": "RateLimitModule (forRoot / forRootAsync)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "ConfigurableModuleBuilder registration with RATE_LIMIT_MODULE_OPTIONS and isGlobal extra; reports invalid configuration as AponiaError INVALID_RATE_LIMIT with frozen issue list.",
